---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, PHONE, PHONE_TEL } from '../../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<BaseHead title={`Emergency Plumbing | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Emergency plumbing service in Yucaipa, CA. Burst pipes, major leaks, and no-water emergencies — prompt response." />
</head>
<body>
	<Header />

	<section class="page-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Emergency Plumbing</h1>
			<p>When water is flooding or you have no water at all — we respond promptly.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="content">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="content-grid">
				<div>
					<h2>Plumbing Emergencies We Handle</h2>
					<p>Some plumbing problems cannot wait. We prioritize true emergencies so you can protect your property and restore service quickly.</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Burst or broken pipes</li>
						<li>Major leaks flooding floors or walls</li>
						<li>Sewer backups</li>
						<li>No water to the home</li>
						<li>Gas line concerns (coordinate with utility as needed)</li>
						<li>Overflowing toilets or fixtures that will not shut off</li>
					</ul>
					
					<h3>What to Do First</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>Shut off the main water valve if safe to do so</li>
						<li>Turn off electricity to affected areas if water is near outlets</li>
						<li>Call us with a clear description of the problem</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3>Local Response</h3>
					<p>As a Yucaipa-based plumber, we aim to respond as quickly as possible to emergency calls in our service area. Leave a detailed message if we are on another job — we return emergency calls promptly.</p>
					
					<h3>After the Emergency</h3>
					<p>Once the immediate issue is under control, we can discuss permanent repairs, pipe replacement, or other work needed to prevent a repeat.</p>
					
					<div class="mt-2">
						<a href={`tel:${PHONE_TEL}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Now: {PHONE}</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="cta">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Plumbing Emergency?</h2>
			<p>Call right away for help in Yucaipa and nearby areas.</p>
			<a href={`tel:${PHONE_TEL}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {PHONE}</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<Footer />
</body>
</html>
